      (https://github.com/Cyberfilo/foodiy), licensed under the Foodiy
      Source-Available License (FSAL) v1.1.';
  (c) remain subject to this license, including the tier, notification,
      user-cap, and commercial-approval obligations.

You may not sublicense, relicense, or change the license of a Derivative
Work. You may not add additional restrictions beyond this license.

