Derivative Works and Active Deployments) from systems under Your control,
and, if You have distributed Derivative Works, take reasonable steps to
notify downstream users of the termination.

The Author may, at The Author's discretion, reinstate Your rights upon
cure of the breach and written confirmation of compliance.

