Short summary (NOT legally binding; the text above controls):

  PERSONAL (free): run Foodiy for yourself + friends/family,
  fewer than 10 users per deployment. Tell me you're doing it.

  COMMUNITY DEV (free): fork it, collaborate, publish improvements,
  run dev/beta instances for fewer than 25 users. Tell me about changes.
  Keep it non-commercial.

  COMMERCIAL (requires agreement): if you improve or enhance Foodiy for
  any commercial application, I need to be (1) informed AND (2) included
  as a participating party — with specific terms negotiated between us.

All contact: filippo@menghi.dev   (subject prefix "[FOODIY-FSAL ...]")
